@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.46.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.46.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.46.0 (2026-11-25): The deliverable of scope change SC11_NoAnalogies is groomed into one story with an acceptance criterion and three tasks. Grooming comes before any build file."""@en .

ex:AC11_NoAnalogies a backlog:AcceptanceCriterion ; rdfs:label "The decks of chapters 10 and 11 (41 slides each), their notes, the chapter 10 code source and the chapter 11 page lecture text contain no comparison with an everyday thing; the twelve former analogy slides keep titles of four words or more and now state plainly what each concept is and does; deck checks, code check and the page tests pass and are logged."@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 .
ex:ST11_NoAnalogies a backlog:Story ; rdfs:label "Chapters 10 and 11: plain explanations instead of everyday analogies"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasState backlog:Ready ;
    backlog:appliesDefinitionOfDone ex:DoD11 ; backlog:hasAcceptanceCriterion ex:AC11_NoAnalogies ;
    backlog:decomposesInto ex:TK11_NoAnalogies_Content, ex:TK11_NoAnalogies_Rebuild, ex:TK11_NoAnalogies_Verify .
ex:TK11_NoAnalogies_Content a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Write plain slide texts and notes for the twelve slides, replace the summary and practice sentences, fix the note and code source phrases, in new content versions"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Build ; backlog:hasState backlog:Ready .
ex:TK11_NoAnalogies_Rebuild a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Build the two decks and the two pages in new versions from the new content"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Build ; backlog:hasState backlog:Blocked ;
    backlog:dependsOn ex:TK11_NoAnalogies_Content .
ex:TK11_NoAnalogies_Verify a backlog:ExecutionTask ; rdfs:label "Run deck checks, code check and full page tests, search all outputs for analogy wording, read the logs"@en ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage11 ; backlog:hasTaskType backlog:TaskType_Verify ; backlog:hasState backlog:Blocked ;
    backlog:dependsOn ex:TK11_NoAnalogies_Rebuild .
